px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cblockquote style=\"margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e\u003c/blockquote\u003e","created_at":1448217593,"title":"Parindra [CTW] 1.8","replies":[{"id":251230,"author":"uple","body":"Vouch","body_tagged":"Vouch","created_at":1448217914},{"id":251231,"author":"NovaLikesPvP","body":"Ese Nova Se Merece Una Ola.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+1,0.","body_tagged":"Ese Nova Se Merece Una Ola.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e+1,0.","created_at":1448217991},{"id":251232,"author":"Bloodoh","body":"vouch 10+ LINSE","body_tagged":"vouch 10+ LINSE","created_at":1448218593},{"id":251243,"author":"Arigenn","body":"The shape of the actual map is pretty good, nothing blocky. One thing i don't exactly like, is the flatness of the map. There are little structures to work with, and there really isn't even a pattern to the floor. At some parts, its actually really wide, and its a long way for some people to travel. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOther than that, the map is pretty good! Maybe you can also add a middle island(s) and maybe replace the wool locations, so the map doesn't become stalematey.","body_tagged":"The shape of the actual map is pretty good, nothing blocky. One thing i don't exactly like, is the flatness of the map. There are little structures to work with, and there really isn't even a pattern to the floor. At some parts, its actually really wide, and its a long way for some people to travel. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eOther than that, the map is pretty good! Maybe you can also add a middle island(s) and maybe replace the wool locations, so the map doesn't become stalematey.","created_at":1448219700},{"id":251305,"author":"Indicado"